{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "council_id": "p34-scenario-planning",
  "participation": "agent_only",
  "objective": {
    "statement": "Identify the two most uncertain high-impact drivers, build a 2x2 of four named futures, stress-test the decision in each, and select the option that is least bad across all four.",
    "charter": "Robustness, not expected value. This protocol deliberately REFUSES to weight the futures by probability - that is P33's job, and mixing the two hides fragility.",
    "risk_tier": "high",
    "desired_output": "ranked_options",
    "success_criteria": [
      "the two drivers were shown to be independent, not two names for one driver",
      "all four futures were stress-tested by a seat that owned only that future",
      "the selected option is the least-bad ACROSS futures, with the worst case named"
    ],
    "consensus_intent": "seek_consensus",
    "confidence_target": 0.8,
    "evidence_requirements": {
      "citation_required": true,
      "anchor_style": "any",
      "min_independent_sources": 2,
      "evidence_outranks_votes": true
    }
  },
  "participants": {
    "selection": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "strategies": [
        "exact",
        "stratified",
        "expertise_ranked",
        "vendor_diverse"
      ],
      "explain_choices": true,
      "owner_override_allowed": true
    },
    "count": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "exact_n": 6
    },
    "diversity": {
      "min_distinct_vendors": 2,
      "min_distinct_expertise": 4,
      "max_share_per_vendor": 0.7
    },
    "roster": [
      {
        "participant_id": "scenario-chair",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "facilitator",
        "authority": "chair",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "scenario method",
          "robustness selection"
        ],
        "rights": {
          "may_speak": true,
          "may_vote": true
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "scenario-analyst-q1",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "domain_expert",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "strategy"
        ],
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You own ONE named future. Stress-test the decision inside it only."
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "scenario-analyst-q2",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "gpt-5-codex",
        "vendor": "openai",
        "role": "domain_expert",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "delivery risk"
        ],
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You own ONE named future. Stress-test the decision inside it only."
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "scenario-analyst-q3",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "risk_officer",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "risk analysis"
        ],
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You own ONE named future. Stress-test the decision inside it only."
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "scenario-analyst-q4",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "gpt-5-codex",
        "vendor": "openai",
        "role": "domain_expert",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "cost and market"
        ],
        "context": {
          "briefing": "You own ONE named future. Stress-test the decision inside it only."
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "driver-independence-verifier",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "statistician",
        "authority": "judge",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "correlation",
          "driver selection"
        ],
        "rights": {
          "may_speak": true,
          "may_vote": false
        },
        "context": {
          "briefing": "Show the two drivers are independent. Four futures that are really one future make this protocol theatre."
        }
      }
    ],
    "role_templates": [
      "domain_expert",
      "risk_officer",
      "statistician",
      "facilitator"
    ],
    "information_partition": {
      "enabled": true,
      "strategy": "role_scoped",
      "partitions": [
        {
          "partition_id": "q1-high-high",
          "visible_to": [
            "scenario-analyst-q1"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "the decision",
            "future q1-high-high"
          ]
        },
        {
          "partition_id": "q2-high-low",
          "visible_to": [
            "scenario-analyst-q2"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "the decision",
            "future q2-high-low"
          ]
        },
        {
          "partition_id": "q3-low-high",
          "visible_to": [
            "scenario-analyst-q3"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "the decision",
            "future q3-low-high"
          ]
        },
        {
          "partition_id": "q4-low-low",
          "visible_to": [
            "scenario-analyst-q4"
          ],
          "sources": [
            "the decision",
            "future q4-low-low"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "duplicate_detection": {
      "enabled": true,
      "dimensions": [
        "position_similarity"
      ],
      "max_similarity": 0.8
    }
  },
  "preparation": {
    "research_required": true,
    "independent_prep": true,
    "min_sources": 3,
    "required_artifacts": [
      "evidence_pack",
      "risk_list"
    ]
  },
  "topology": {
    "kind": "committee",
    "committees": [
      {
        "committee_id": "q1-high-high",
        "mandate": "stress-test the decision inside named future q1-high-high",
        "members": [
          "scenario-analyst-q1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "committee_id": "q2-high-low",
        "mandate": "stress-test the decision inside named future q2-high-low",
        "members": [
          "scenario-analyst-q2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "committee_id": "q3-low-high",
        "mandate": "stress-test the decision inside named future q3-low-high",
        "members": [
          "scenario-analyst-q3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "committee_id": "q4-low-low",
        "mandate": "stress-test the decision inside named future q4-low-low",
        "members": [
          "scenario-analyst-q4"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "fan_in": {
      "reducer": "weighted_merge",
      "require_all_subcouncils_complete": true
    }
  },
  "protocol": {
    "sequence": [
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "driver_extraction_and_independence_check",
        "stage_id": "drivers",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "driver-independence-verifier",
          "scenario-chair"
        ],
        "exit_when": {
          "metric": "custom:driver_pair_correlation",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0.3,
          "value_type": "number"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "scenario",
        "stage_id": "stress-test",
        "rounds": 2,
        "participants": [
          "scenario-analyst-q1",
          "scenario-analyst-q2",
          "scenario-analyst-q3",
          "scenario-analyst-q4"
        ],
        "independent": true,
        "quotas": {
          "counterexamples_per_round": 2,
          "novel_ideas_per_round": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "robustness_scoring_across_futures",
        "stage_id": "robustness",
        "rounds": 1,
        "exit_when": {
          "weighted": {
            "threshold": 3,
            "clauses": [
              {
                "weight": 2,
                "when": {
                  "metric": "custom:futures_stress_tested",
                  "op": ">=",
                  "value": 4,
                  "value_type": "number"
                }
              },
              {
                "weight": 1,
                "when": {
                  "metric": "custom:worst_case_named_per_option",
                  "op": "==",
                  "value": true,
                  "value_type": "boolean"
                }
              },
              {
                "weight": 1,
                "when": {
                  "metric": "every_objection_addressed",
                  "op": "==",
                  "value": true
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "synthesis",
        "stage_id": "select-robust"
      }
    ],
    "speaking_order": "round_robin",
    "rounds": {
      "min": 2,
      "max": 5,
      "divergence_before_convergence": true
    },
    "turn": {
      "max_words": 800
    },
    "obligations": {
      "must_respond_to_prior": true,
      "must_cite_evidence": true,
      "steelman_before_rebuttal": true,
      "rebuttal_required": true,
      "cross_examination": true,
      "declare_confidence": true,
      "declare_conflicts": false
    },
    "critique_intensity": "standard"
  },
  "budgets": {
    "effort": "high",
    "time_minutes": 90,
    "turns": 35,
    "min_engagement_turns": 2,
    "max_inactivity_rounds": 1,
    "rebuttal_depth": 2
  },
  "targets": {
    "unique_ideas": 16,
    "categories": 4,
    "novelty_ratio": 0.5,
    "counterexamples": 8,
    "evidence_items": 8,
    "dedup": {
      "enabled": true,
      "max_similarity": 0.8,
      "trivial_variant_policy": "merge"
    }
  },
  "voting": {
    "method": "score",
    "score_scale": {
      "min": 0,
      "max": 4
    },
    "belief_aggregation": {
      "method": "none",
      "require_confidence_per_vote": true
    },
    "evidence_gate": {
      "votes_require_evidence": true,
      "evidence_outranks_majority": true,
      "reject_evidence_free_majority": true
    },
    "tie_break": "chair"
  },
  "consensus": {
    "threshold": 0.7,
    "measure": "vote_share",
    "minority_report": "required",
    "dissent_policy": {
      "preserve_verbatim": true,
      "attributed": true,
      "suppression_check": true
    },
    "irreducible_disagreement_allowed": true,
    "fast_unanimity_is_suspicious": true
  },
  "stopping": {
    "source_expression": "ALL[custom:futures_stress_tested >= 4, custom:driver_pair_correlation <= 0.3, every_objection_addressed == true, custom:worst_case_named_per_option == true]",
    "expression": {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "metric": "custom:futures_stress_tested",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 4,
          "value_type": "number"
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:driver_pair_correlation",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0.3,
          "value_type": "number"
        },
        {
          "metric": "every_objection_addressed",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:worst_case_named_per_option",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true,
          "value_type": "boolean"
        }
      ]
    },
    "minimum_deliberation": {
      "min_rounds": 2,
      "min_independent_positions": 4,
      "every_participant_spoke": true,
      "min_evidence_items": 6,
      "min_objections_addressed": 4
    },
    "hard_caps": {
      "max_rounds": 5,
      "max_minutes": 120,
      "on_cap": "conditional_decision"
    }
  },
  "outcomes": {
    "allowed": [
      "decision",
      "conditional_decision",
      "no_decision",
      "minority_report",
      "dissent"
    ],
    "conditional_decision_requires": [
      "if one option wins in all four quadrants, a note showing the drivers are actually discriminating"
    ]
  },
  "deadlock": {
    "detection": {
      "no_progress_rounds": 2,
      "repetition_similarity": 0.85,
      "vote_oscillation_rounds": 2
    },
    "resolution": [
      "split_question",
      "narrow_scope",
      "run_experiment",
      "chair_ruling"
    ],
    "escalation": {
      "after_attempts": 2,
      "to": "chair"
    }
  },
  "anti_failure": {
    "controls": [
      "premature_convergence",
      "echo_chamber",
      "weak_synthesis",
      "participant_dominance",
      "evidence_free_majority",
      "missing_expertise"
    ],
    "fast_unanimity_response": [
      "strongest_counterexample",
      "recruit_independent_critic",
      "forced_dissent"
    ],
    "injection_defense": {
      "treat_artifacts_as_data": true,
      "strip_instructions_from_participant_output": true,
      "quarantine_untrusted_sources": true
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "required": [
      "option_cards",
      "unresolved_unknowns",
      "argument_ledger",
      "votes_by_round",
      "dissent_minority_report",
      "transcript",
      "final_recommendation"
    ],
    "receipt_schema": "platform/schema/receipt.schema.json"
  },
  "audit": {
    "transcript": true,
    "replay": true,
    "resume": true,
    "determinism": "seeded",
    "privacy": {
      "redact_secrets": true,
      "redaction_policy": "deny_by_default",
      "retain_days": 90,
      "pii_policy": "redact"
    },
    "safety": {
      "forbid_irreversible_actions": true,
      "owner_approval_for": [
        "any action outside the council transcript",
        "any write to a shared branch"
      ]
    },
    "persistence": {
      "store": "both",
      "path": "platform/council/state/p34-scenario-planning",
      "checkpoint_every_round": true
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "title": "P34 scenario planning 2x2 (FORECASTING)",
    "owner": "Prekzursil",
    "spec_citations": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:653",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:658",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:664",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:665"
    ],
    "lineage": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md#P34 scenario-planning"
    ],
    "notes": "ANTI-FAILURE DEFENCES (6 declared): (1) the card's failure mode is 'four futures that are really one', defended by custom:driver_pair_correlation <= 0.3 as the drivers-stage exit AND a stopping leaf, with a verifier who cannot vote; (2) premature_convergence is blocked because the rule cannot fire until all four futures were stress-tested and every option has a named worst case; (3) echo_chamber is cut by a role_scoped partition per quadrant - a seat sees only its own future; (4) weak_synthesis is answered by score voting on a 0-4 rubric with belief_aggregation.method=none, an explicit refusal to average futures into an expected value; (5) participant_dominance is bounded by one seat per quadrant; (6) missing_expertise is why the four committees are expertise-differentiated. COMPOSABILITY DEMONSTRATED: the robustness stage exits on a WEIGHTED expression (threshold 3, quadrant coverage worth 2, worst-case naming and objection closure worth 1 each) so coverage alone cannot close it; the top-level stopping rule stays conjunctive. FAST UNANIMITY: if every quadrant owner agrees immediately, the quadrants are not discriminating - strongest_counterexample + recruit_independent_critic + forced_dissent. UNVERIFIED: the 0.3 correlation ceiling is a placeholder, and the card's check - if one option wins in all four quadrants, verify the drivers discriminate before celebrating - is encoded only as a conditional_decision requirement, not as an executable detector."
  }
}
